doc:sec-10a a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "10A References to photograph or other image of person’s face" ;
    values:kind "section" ;
    values:originalText "A reference in the citizenship law to a photograph or other image of a person’s face includes a reference to a photograph or other image of:  (a) the person’s face and all or part of the person’s neck; or  (b) the person’s face and neck and all or part of the person’s shoulders." ;
