    values:originalText "(1A) If:  (a) the person was absent from Australia for a part of the period of 4 years immediately before the day the person made the application; and  (b) the total period of the absence or absences was not more than 12 months; then, for the purposes of paragraph (1)(a), the person is taken to have been present in Australia during each period of absence." ;
