concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-22-ss-1b cml:asserts concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-22-ss-1b-logic-deontic-1 .
concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-22-ss-1b-logic-deontic-1 a cml:LogicApplication ;
