doc:sec-25-ss-1 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "25(1) Minister may cancel approval" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by writing, cancel an approval given to a person under section 24 if:  (a) the person has not become an Australian citizen under section 28; and  (b) either of the following 2 situations apply. Eligibility criteria not met" ;
    cof:pageNumber "59"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-25-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "25(2) Minister may cancel approval"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-25-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The first situation applies if:  (a) the person is covered by subsection 21(2), (3) or (4); and  (b) the Minister is satisfied that, at the time the Minister proposes to cancel the approval, the person is:  (i) not a permanent resident; or  (ii) not likely to reside, or to continue to reside, in Australia or to maintain a close and continuing association with Australia; or  (iii) not of good character. Failure to make pledge of commitment" ;
    skos:definition "(2) The first situation applies if:  (a) the person is covered by subsection 21(2), (3) or (4); and  (b) the Minister is satisfied that, at the time the Minister proposes to cancel the approval, the person is:  (i) not a permanent resident; or  (ii) not likely to reside, or to continue to reside, in Australia or to maintain a close and continuing association with Australia; or  (iii) not of good character. Failure to make pledge of commitment"@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "c6e75ecc8086ed027db4edf742e841cb5ed9bb9f7f64379dc77c8ce679ec08bf" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-25 ;
    cof:pageNumber "59"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Minister may cancel approval under certain conditions." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
