doc:sec-26-3-ss-2 a cof:Section ;
    cof:title "26(2) Pledge of commitment must be made" ;
    values:kind "subsection" ;
    values:originalText "(2) A person must not make a pledge of commitment before the Minister approves the person’s application to become an Australian citizen. A pledge of commitment made by the person before that time is of no effect. Delayed making of pledge" ;
    cof:pageNumber "60"^^xsd:integer .

concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-26-3-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "26(3) Pledge of commitment must be made"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-26-3-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) If the person is required to make a pledge of commitment and has not done so, the Minister may determine, in writing, that the person cannot make the pledge until the end of a specified period if the Minister is satisfied that:  (a) a visa held by the person may be cancelled under the Migration Act 1958 (whether or not the person has been given any notice to that effect); or  (b) the person has been or may be charged with an offence under an Australian law." ;
    skos:definition "(3) If the person is required to make a pledge of commitment and has not done so, the Minister may determine, in writing, that the person cannot make the pledge until the end of a specified period if the Minister is satisfied that:  (a) a visa held by the person may be cancelled under the Migration Act 1958 (whether or not the person has been given any notice to that effect); or  (b) the person has been or may be charged with an offence under an Australian law."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "d110ecfbf68eace8991f86883653d731982b0677fe2458779fc574c7b10f0532" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-26-3 ;
    cof:pageNumber "60"^^xsd:integer ;
    skos:note "Cannot make pledge until end of specified period if visa may be cancelled or offence charged." ;
    cml:curationStatus cml:Proposed ;
    cml:schemaVersion "2" ;
    cml:proposedBy <https://ns.webcivics.net/tools/legis2cml> ;
