concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-28-ss-3 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "28(3) Day citizenship begins etc."@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-28-ss-3 ;
    values:originalText "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply to a child aged under 16 at the time the child made the application to become an Australian citizen if:  (a) 1 or more responsible parents of the child made applications under section 21 at that time; and  (b) the Minister decided under section 24 to approve the child and 1 or more of the responsible parents becoming Australian citizens." ;
    skos:definition "(3) Subsection (2) does not apply to a child aged under 16 at the time the child made the application to become an Australian citizen if:  (a) 1 or more responsible parents of the child made applications under section 21 at that time; and  (b) the Minister decided under section 24 to approve the child and 1 or more of the responsible parents becoming Australian citizens."@en ;
    cml:integrityHash "83f4f96462a2d063338cd3feaa9a2b36271440fedf21d6ddd96c110c67a48599" ;
    values:partOf concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-28 ;
