concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-36-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36(2) Children of responsible parents who cease to be citizens"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-36-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) If, at the cessation time, another responsible parent of the child is an Australian citizen, subsection (1) does not apply to the child:  (a) while there is a responsible parent who is an Australian citizen; and  (b) if there ceases to be such a responsible parent because of the death of a responsible parent—at any time after that death. Exception—statelessness" ;
    skos:definition "(2) If, at the cessation time, another responsible parent of the child is an Australian citizen, subsection (1) does not apply to the child:  (a) while there is a responsible parent who is an Australian citizen; and  (b) if there ceases to be such a responsible parent because of the death of a responsible parent—at any time after that death. Exception—statelessness"@en ;
