concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-36d-ss-4 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36D(4) Application by the Minister for a citizenship cessation order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-36d-ss-4 ;
    values:originalText "(4) The application must include the following matters:  (a) information about the person’s age;  (b) information about the person’s Australian citizenship;  (c) information about the person’s nationality or citizenship of other countries." ;
    skos:definition "(4) The application must include the following matters:  (a) information about the person’s age;  (b) information about the person’s Australian citizenship;  (c) information about the person’s nationality or citizenship of other countries."@en ;
