concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-36d-ss-6 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "36D(6) Application by the Minister for a citizenship cessation order"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-36d-ss-6 ;
    values:originalText "(6) The Minister must give the person written notice of the application as soon as practicable after the application is made. The Minister may also give written notice of the application to such other persons as the Minister considers appropriate." ;
    skos:definition "(6) The Minister must give the person written notice of the application as soon as practicable after the application is made. The Minister may also give written notice of the application to such other persons as the Minister considers appropriate."@en ;
