    values:originalText "(3) A request given to a person under subsection (1) or (2) must:  (a) be made in writing; and  (b) specify the day on or before which the person must surrender the notice (which must be a day at least 28 days after the day on which the Minister makes the request); and  (c) specify how the person is to surrender the notice to the Minister; and  (d) contain a statement to the effect that a failure to comply with the request is an offence. Offence" ;
