concept:australian-citizenship-act-2007-sec-46-ss-2 a cml:Concept ;
    skos:prefLabel "46(2) Application requirements"@en ;
    cml:realizedBy doc:sec-46-ss-2 ;
    values:originalText "(2) The Minister may, by writing, approve one or more forms for the purposes of a provision of this Act under which an application may be made. Note: For example, there are 2 ways to become an Australian citizen by descent under section 16. The Minister may approve 1 form for the purposes of that section or may approve 2 different forms." ;
    skos:definition "(2) The Minister may, by writing, approve one or more forms for the purposes of a provision of this Act under which an application may be made. Note: For example, there are 2 ways to become an Australian citizen by descent under section 16. The Minister may approve 1 form for the purposes of that section or may approve 2 different forms."@en ;
