    values:originalText "(1) The Minister may, by writing, delegate to any person all or any of the Minister’s functions or powers under this Act or the regulations.  (2) However, subsection (1) does not apply in relation to the function under subsection 23A(1) (about approval of citizenship test) or the" ;
